1
00:00:06,190 --> 00:00:06,890
(Howard:)What do we owe you?

2
00:00:06,910 --> 00:00:08,990
(Leonard:)It came to $28.17.

3
00:00:08,990 --> 00:00:10,130
(Leonard:)Let's say six bucks apiece.

4
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:11,880
(Howard:)Here you go.

5
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:14,530
(Leonard:)Thank you.

6
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:19,250
(Penny:)What?

7
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:20,550
(Leonard:)Never mind. I got it.

8
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:22,090
(Penny:)Oh, you wanted me to pay.

9
00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:24,340
(Leonard:)It's no big deal.
No, no, no, no.
You're right.

10
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:26,760
We're not going out anymore;
I should pay for myself.

11
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:30,730
(Penny:)What?

12
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:33,050
He said, "If he had
woman parts,

13
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:36,640
(Howard:)he'd eat for free
the rest of his life".

14
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:39,820
(Penny:)Yeah, but you wouldn't be able
to talk to yourself.

15
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:44,460
(Penny:)I'm a little low on cash.

16
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:46,550
(Leonard:)How much you got?
Nothing.

17
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:48,080
(Leonard:)How can you walk
around with no money?

18
00:00:48,080 --> 00:00:49,730
(Penny:)I'm cute. I get by.

19
00:00:49,730 --> 00:00:51,500
(Leonard:)It's okay,
you can owe me.

20
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:52,740
(Leonard:)Thank you.
Sheldon, six bucks.

21
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:56,510
(Sheldon:)No, thank you.
I'm not eating pizza tonight.

22
00:00:56,510 --> 00:00:57,590
(Penny:)But it's Thursday.

23
00:00:57,590 --> 00:00:59,240
(Penny:)Thursday's pizza night.

24
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:00,330
(Sheldon:)Not for me.

25
00:01:00,330 --> 00:01:03,410
(Sheldon:)Thursday is now Cruciferous
Vegetable Night.

